================================================================================
Scope
================================================================================

This licence covers everything under haiku/ — the native Haiku VST3 build of
BigBubbleMuff. It does NOT cover the Linux build in the repository root: src/
and the Linux CMake target link JUCE and are therefore GPL-3.0-or-later (see
../COPYING). The two trees share no code at build time; the circuit sources
under haiku/source/dsp/ are copies, relicensed by their author, and contain no
JUCE and no third-party code.


